  "title": "US News Outlets Sue Trump for Media Ban",
  "summary": "Major US networks, including CNN, MS NOW, and Politico, have filed lawsuits against President Trump's administration to restore their access to the White House, citing concerns about the ban's impact on First Amendment rights and media freedom.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The three major US news outlets (CNN, MS NOW, and Politico) have filed lawsuits against President Trump's administration to restore their access to the White House",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The lawsuit seeks to overturn the ban that stripped them of their White House access",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The case is being heard in the U.S. District Court for the District of Columbia",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
